\import{macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}

\taxon{Definition}
\title{Capability acquisition}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{evaluation}

\p{Fix a capability claim in \ref{ftip-0003}, a prespecified transfer
evaluation #{E^{+}}, and thresholds #{0\leq\varepsilon_0<\varepsilon_1\leq1}.
Let #{u_0} and #{u_1} be the probabilities of passing #{E^{+}} before and
after the intervention, using the same evaluation protocol and budget. An
\newvocab{acquisition witness} is the pair of inequalities
##{
u_0\leq\varepsilon_0
\qquad\text{and}\qquad
u_1\geq\varepsilon_1.
}
The transfer evaluation must not be used to select training examples, rewards,
or checkpoints.}

\p{An acquisition witness is operational. It records a large, independently
measured change under one declared procedure; it does not prove that the
starting model assigned mathematical probability zero to every successful
continuation.}
